    <bpmn:process id="W_W3685" name="W3685. Certification Cost, Lead-Time &amp; Landed-Cost Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program reporting cycle; landed-cost review
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Enterprise certification cost and lead-time
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Finance
Participants: Product Compliance Manager, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Import (links to VS-02.2), BI (links to VS-28.1), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Quality (links to VS-31)
Source: workflow W3685 — Certification Cost, Lead-Time &amp; Landed-Cost Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
