    <bpmn:process id="W_W3686" name="W3686. Vendor Recovery, Penalty &amp; Certification Chargeback" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sample failure (W3679); non-conformance corrective action (W3684); DTI penalty
Frequency: On event
Volume: Per qualifying event
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Vendor Management / Finance
Participants: Product Compliance Manager, Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Finance (links to VS-15/VS-17), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Vendor Scorecard (links to VS-67), Quality (links to VS-31)
Source: workflow W3686 — Vendor Recovery, Penalty &amp; Certification Chargeback</bpmn:documentation>
