    <bpmn:process id="W_W3687" name="W3687. Multi-Entity Certification Coordination &amp; Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Multi-entity sourcing; entity-level certification obligation; consolidated reporting
Frequency: Ongoing + per event
Volume: 5 legal entities
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Cross-Entity Shared Services
Participants: Product Compliance Manager, Cross-Entity Shared Services (links to VS-72), Regulatory Officer (links to VS-22), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Finance (links to VS-17.2), Records (links to VS-88), Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3687 — Multi-Entity Certification Coordination &amp; Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3687_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3687_Lane1" name="Product Compliance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3687_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3687_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3687_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3687_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3687_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3687_Start3" name="Multi-entity sourcing; entity-level certification obligation; consolidated reporting">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3687_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3687_Task4" name="Product Compliance Manager coordinate certification across the 5 legal entities…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Product Compliance Manager coordinate certification across the 5 legal entities (BuildRight Depot Inc. as inventory owner, Logistics Inc. at DCs, Digital Commerce Inc. online, Property Management Inc., Holdings): confirm which entity holds the certification obligation per sourcing/sale, manage entity-level BPS engagement, and reconcile shared regulated-stock certification status
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Cross-Entity Shared Services
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3687_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3687_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3687_Task5" name="Product Compliance Manager/Cross-Entity manage intercompany certification cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Product Compliance Manager/Cross-Entity manage intercompany certification cost allocation: where one entity incurs certification cost on behalf of another (e.g., Depot Inc. inventory certified at a Logistics Inc. DC), allocate the cost per the shared-services model (links to VS-72.1) and intercompany billing (links to VS-72.2)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Cross-Entity / Finance
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3687_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3687_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3687_Task6" name="Product Compliance Manager/Records consolidate the certification register and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Product Compliance Manager/Records consolidate the certification register and reporting across entities for group audit, BIR/SEC, and DTI-BPS purposes (links to VS-88/VS-17.2), and support entity-level and consolidated audit response (links to VS-21/W3672)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Records / Cross-Entity
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3687_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3687_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3687_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
