        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-582 (ensure controlled execution — Market Surveillance, Compliance Monitoring &amp; Certification Analytics (PA-117.3).) | - operational: entity-mapping; operational: shared-services allocation
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Cross-Entity Shared Services</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
