    <bpmn:process id="W_W3688" name="W3688. Certification Program Analytics &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program review cycle; governance reporting
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Program KPIs and analytics
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / BI
Participants: Product Compliance Manager, BI (links to VS-28.1), Audit (links to VS-21), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Quality (links to VS-31), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Governance (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3688 — Certification Program Analytics &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3688_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3688_Lane1" name="Product Compliance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3688_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3688_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3688_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3688_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3688_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3688_Start3" name="Program review cycle; governance reporting">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3688_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3688_Task4" name="Product Compliance Manager/BI maintain the certification program KPI dashboard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Product Compliance Manager/BI maintain the certification program KPI dashboard: regulated-product register coverage, PS-license currency rate, ICC cycle-time and clearance rate, sticker integrity, market-surveillance findings, non-conformance rate, stop-sale events, certification cost/lead-time, and vendor recovery rate
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / BI
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3688_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3688_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3688_Task5" name="Product Compliance Manager analyze trends and root causes: recurring…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Product Compliance Manager analyze trends and root causes: recurring non-conformance vendors/categories, lead-time drivers, cost outliers, and regulatory-change impact; identify program improvements (lab diversification, SOC shift, gating hardening, vendor development)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Quality / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3688_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3688_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3688_Task6" name="Product Compliance Manager drive continuous improvement: implement program…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Product Compliance Manager drive continuous improvement: implement program changes, track effectiveness, and report program performance and maturity to governance (links to W3665/VS-36), audit (links to VS-21), and the executive risk committee (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3688_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3688_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3688_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3688_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-582 (ensure controlled execution — Market Surveillance, Compliance Monitoring &amp; Certification Analytics (PA-117.3).) | - operational: KPI dashboard; operational: continuous-improvement cycle
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / BI</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
